  The canonical table assigns: opus to spec-writer, strategist, architect, aligner, auditor; sonnet to domain-expert, implementor, QA. The spec has domain-expert on opus (should be sonnet) and researcher on sonnet (agent no longer exists; domain-expert is the research agent and is sonnet). The model assignment description is inverted for the renamed roles.
